  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Exclusive Dental Offers to Brighten Your Smile at Mason Park Dental of Katy",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Dentist Katy, TX",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Your Local Dentist in Katy, TX: Attractive Specials Awaiting.Embark on your journey to a dazzling smile with Mason Park Dental of Katy’s special offers. Located at 21830 Kingsland Blvd #104A, we’re delighted to extend these exclusive promotions to our Katy community. For inquiries or to schedule, call us at +1 281-769-8878.",
   "html": "<p>Your Local Dentist in Katy, TX: Attractive Specials Awaiting.<br>Embark on your journey to a dazzling smile with Mason Park Dental of Katy’s special offers. Located at 21830 Kingsland Blvd #104A, we’re delighted to extend these exclusive promotions to our Katy community. For inquiries or to schedule, call us at +1 281-769-8878.</p>",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "$189 NEW PATIENT SPECIAL",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "For just $189, get a comprehensive exam, x-rays, a cleaning, and full treatment plan. That’s $328 in savings!",
   "html": "<p>For just&nbsp;<strong>$189</strong>, get a comprehensive exam, x-rays, a cleaning, and full treatment plan. That’s&nbsp;<strong>$328</strong>&nbsp;in savings!</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "$129 NEW PATIENT EXAM (CHILDREN)",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "We offer a $129 new patient exam for children under 13.",
   "html": "<p>We offer a&nbsp;<strong>$129</strong>&nbsp;new patient exam for children under 13.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "$350 NEW PATIENT WHITENING",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "We offer Kor Whitening with at-home trays for $350 for new patients.",
   "html": "<p>We offer Kor Whitening with at-home trays for&nbsp;<strong>$350</strong>&nbsp;for new patients.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "$189 New Patient Special",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2531\"><p>Welcome to your new dental home! New patients can receive a comprehensive dental exam, x-rays, a cleaning, and a full treatment plan for just $189, saving you $328. Please note, this offer is exclusive to new patients and cannot be used in conjunction with insurance or in cases of periodontal disease.</p></div>",
   "text": "$189 New Patient Special",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Pediatric Dental Care Offer: $129 New Patient Exam",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2532\"><p>Start your child’s dental journey on the right foot with our New Patient Exam for children under 13, priced at just $129. At Mason Park Family Dental, we’re committed to nurturing young smiles with gentle care.</p></div>",
   "text": "Pediatric Dental Care Offer: $129 New Patient Exam",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Brighten Up: $350 New Patient Whitening",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2533\"><p>Achieve a brighter smile with our Kor Whitening service, complete with at-home trays for $350. This new patient offer is the first step towards the radiant smile you’ve always desired.</p></div>",
   "text": "Brighten Up: $350 New Patient Whitening",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Complimentary Invisalign Consultation",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2534\"><p>Discover the path to straighter teeth with a complimentary Invisalign consultation. Our Katy dentist team is ready to guide you through the process with personalized care.</p></div>",
   "text": "Complimentary Invisalign Consultation",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "faq",
   "question": "Invisalign Special: $1000 Off",
   "html": "<div data-tab=\"5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-2535\"><p>Embrace the confidence of a perfectly aligned smile with $1000 off the regular price of Invisalign. Originally $4800, we’re offering this transformative treatment for just $3800. Take advantage of an additional $500 off by prepaying in full, with insurance reimbursements directly returned to you. Call us for details.</p></div>",
   "text": "Invisalign Special: $1000 Off",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Mason Park Dental of Katy provides a suite of services including cosmetic dentistry, sedation dentistry, and advanced technology applications in comprehensive care. Dr. William Sung, alongside Dr. Dave Cho and Dr. Tam Nguyen, is eager to deliver excellence in oral surgery, extractions, dental implants, and root canal therapy.",
   "html": "<p>Mason Park Dental of Katy provides a suite of services including cosmetic dentistry, sedation dentistry, and advanced technology applications in comprehensive care. Dr. William Sung, alongside Dr. Dave Cho and Dr. Tam Nguyen, is eager to deliver excellence in oral surgery, extractions, dental implants, and root canal therapy.</p>",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "cta",
   "text": "LEARN MORE",
   "href": "#",
   "section": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "embed",
